From a365832049709954fab0bfd5448a99f98f78bdea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yekai pan <pyk@seas.upenn.edu>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:05:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] l2r-local: bug 18: build every archive build.rs links before
 the cargo targets

The README lists `cmake --build build --target rrc` as a workflow, but in
a fresh build directory it failed: cargo could not find the native
static library MLIRReussirInstrumentNonlinearFFI. The cargo targets
(`rrc-build` and the other crates' build targets) depend on ReussirCAPI
and MLIRReussir, and ReussirCAPI depends on the archives listed in
REUSSIR_BACKEND_ARCHIVES (lib/CAPI/CMakeLists.txt) so that they are built
first. `reussir-backend-sys/build.rs` links four archives that are in
neither that list nor ReussirCAPI's link dependencies:
MLIRReussirInstrumentNonlinearFFI, MLIRReussirClosureBetaReduction,
MLIRReussirDefaultInliner and MLIRReussirSpecialPointerTag. The default
target built them anyway, as part of everything.

Add the four to the list (in build.rs's order) and say in its comment
which archives it must cover.

Checked with a fresh build directory and `--target rrc` alone: before,
cargo failed as above; now rrc builds and links, and the ninja edge of
rrc-build depends on all four archives.
---
 lib/CAPI/CMakeLists.txt | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/lib/CAPI/CMakeLists.txt b/lib/CAPI/CMakeLists.txt
index f537d3bc..e48f8336 100644
--- a/lib/CAPI/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/lib/CAPI/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -25,7 +25,11 @@ endif()
 # factories plus the standalone helpers (compilePolymorphicFFI via the
 # CompilePolymorphicFFI pass + ReussirRustCompiler, gatherCompiledModules via
 # MLIRReussir). reussir-backend-sys links these into the final Rust binary; here
-# we only ensure they are built first.
+# we only ensure they are built first. Every archive in REUSSIR_ARCHIVES of
+# crates/reussir-backend-sys/build.rs must be listed here unless it is a link
+# dependency of ReussirCAPI (the LLVM passes above; the sync archives, through
+# MLIRReussir): otherwise building only a cargo target in a fresh build
+# directory (`--target rrc`) does not build it, and cargo cannot link.
 set(REUSSIR_BACKEND_ARCHIVES
   MLIRReussir
   MLIRReussirAnalysis
@@ -40,14 +44,18 @@ set(REUSSIR_BACKEND_ARCHIVES
   MLIRReussirTokenInstantiation
   MLIRReussirClosureOutlining
   MLIRReussirCompilePolymorphicFFI
+  MLIRReussirInstrumentNonlinearFFI
   MLIRReussirAttachNativeTarget
   # transformations
+  MLIRReussirClosureBetaReduction
+  MLIRReussirDefaultInliner
   MLIRReussirRcCreateSink
   MLIRReussirRcCreateFusion
   MLIRReussirRcDispatchFusion
   MLIRReussirInferVariantTag
   MLIRReussirIncDecCancellation
   MLIRReussirTokenReuse
+  MLIRReussirSpecialPointerTag
   MLIRReussirInvariantGroupAnalysis
   MLIRReussirUniqueCarryingRecursionAnalysis
   MLIRReussirTRMCRecursionAnalysis)
